  "extras": [],
  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "Does Arien’s attack require a hero behind the target?",
      "answer": "No, this effect says \"Up to 1 enemy hero\"",
      "source": "goa2-faq"
    },
    {
      "question": "Do Arien’s green skill cards perform movement?",
      "answer": "No. The primary Green places Arien, the alternative Green swaps. These are not movement and are not restricted by effects that restrict movement.",
      "source": "goa2-faq"
    },
    {
      "question": "What does Arien's Slippery Ground restrict?",
      "answer": "This card restricts the movement, by a movement action, of Heroes in radius. It will not affect pushing, swapping, or placement effects (including fast travel!). It also will not restrict movement as part of other actions (such as Brogan’s Primary Red or Tigerclaw’s Primary Green).\nAdditionally, because movement restrictions are checked at the beginning of a movement, a Hero can freely move into and through the radius of Arien’s effect without being affected.",
      "source": "goa2-faq"
    }
  ],
  "lore": "Start mocking his name, and you’ll quickly discover the difference between a mermaid princess and a high elf seafarer.",
